      "target": "# 实时音频处理\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0002",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing"
      ],
      "ordinal": 1,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0003",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "9977873476c7b82711bc7f0fb3bc23c83538072f1be1fb751cbe7b2c05e0a814",
      "target": "> 批处理管线处理一个文件。实时管线则要在下一段 20 毫秒的音频到来之前，处理完当前这段 20 毫秒的音频。每个对话式 AI（人工智能）系统、广播演播室和电话机器人，能否正常运作都取决于能否守住这一延迟预算。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0004",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3,
      "source_sha256": "34c51d35486f33d0a5487bc49cbfdaf587b6473a610f900652b649d8c8c8674e",
      "target": "**Type:** Build\n**Languages:** Python\n**Prerequisites:** 阶段 6 · 02（频谱图）、阶段 6 · 04（ASR）、阶段 6 · 07（TTS）\n**Time:** ~75 分钟\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0006",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "f88026ff32dd8f43def76262b9b1e99e1082ea528c571c9922238a9fa88f4fe5",
      "target": "## 要解决的问题\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0008",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "855278aafd0ceb2d797af5c3da32cb5d682de6ce42b1889891fa5c2c44aef01e",
      "target": "你想要一个交互自然的语音助手。人类对话的话轮交替延迟为 ~230 ms（从静音到响应）。超过 500 ms 就会显得机械；超过 1500 ms 则像是出了故障。2026 年，完整的 **听取 → 理解 → 响应 → 发声** 循环的预算如下：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0010",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0011",
      "kind": "table",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "101cabbe7d8d73310f9f2c1b81d7f9b83c18b5c055f14e9dab51219ea04b0344",
      "target": "| 阶段 | 预算 |\n|-------|--------|\n| 麦克风 → 缓冲区 | 20 ms |\n| 语音活动检测（VAD） | 10 ms |\n| 自动语音识别（ASR，流式处理） | 150 ms |\n| 大语言模型（LLM，首 token〔词元〕） | 100 ms |\n| 文本转语音（TTS，首个音频块） | 100 ms |\n| 渲染 → 扬声器 | 20 ms |\n| **合计** | **~400 ms** |\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0012",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "b94c080f8b773d41b6ebdb29048908c50c81bdfad51b8a0e82e4e7e6fde2dd26",
      "target": "Moshi（Kyutai，2024）的全双工（full duplex）延迟达到了 200 ms。GPT-4o-realtime（2024）的延迟为 ~320 ms。2022 年上线的级联管线延迟为 2500 ms。这 10× 的改进来自三项技术：(1) 全链路采用流式处理，(2) 利用部分结果进行异步管线处理，(3) 可打断的生成。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0014",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "c7b44801605d0b8c776d3915355cff883fdbf9e3ecb29219ac88ef4edd08ab1b",
      "target": "## 核心概念\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0016",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "044892107abb9d98ee87509d36ac53da83691ae967fe77c2b6fd954368f740db",
      "target": "![包含环形缓冲区、VAD 门控和打断机制的流式音频管线](../assets/real-time.svg)\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0018",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "666f177ec47c0a89f1168961625b1d785aa496eb30f6091ea3283373df3e5ff3",
      "target": "**帧 / 音频块 / 窗（frame / chunk / window）。** 实时音频以固定大小的块流动。常见选择是 20 ms（在 16 kHz 下为 320 个采样点）。下游的所有环节都必须跟上这个节奏。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0020",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "d7819a5a63d339253cbf10c98c0d43f7eb2406e346d750e54c403a71f1439893",
      "target": "**环形缓冲区（ring buffer）。** 固定大小的环形缓冲区。生产者线程写入新帧，消费者线程读取。它能避免在关键处理路径（hot path）中分配内存。大小 ≈ 最大延迟 × 采样率；一个能容纳 2 秒音频的 16 kHz 环形缓冲区 = 32,000 个采样点。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0022",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "8c15af36b3b5ba76b2975e66b02ecc455d597c0a7dbf6ac8d07a8f5527046af8",
      "target": "**VAD（Voice Activity Detection，语音活动检测）。** 没有人说话时，用门控阻止下游处理。Silero VAD 4.0（2024）在 CPU（中央处理器）上处理每个 30 ms 帧的耗时 <1 ms。`webrtcvad` 是较老的替代方案。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0024",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "c848590abe05873a4d8b7198c5630ddf9b850202fde04c294dec1d1c0366741c",
      "target": "**流式 ASR。** 这类模型随着音频到达而输出部分转写文本。Parakeet-CTC-0.6B 在流式模式下（NeMo，2024），以 320 ms 的延迟达到 2–5% 的词错误率（WER）。Whisper-Streaming（Macháček 等，2023）将 Whisper 分块运行，以 ~2 s 的延迟实现近流式处理。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0026",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "2da38270705ecf2080099b0d3d8a584d86e5911a3350d97d47c359385e47e203",
      "target": "**打断。** 用户在助手说话时开口，系统必须 (a) 检测插话打断（barge-in），(b) 停止 TTS，(c) 丢弃剩余的 LLM 输出。所有操作都要在 100 ms 内完成，否则用户就会觉得助手听不见自己。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0028",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "8f04f0ebe2d1e84c1ac38c38de45c0919d17f7cd7ecd0a79fda61dce8e9ecce6",
      "target": "**WebRTC Opus 传输。** 20 ms 帧、48 kHz、8–128 kbps 自适应比特率。这是浏览器和移动端的标准方案。LiveKit、Daily.co、Pion 是 2026 年用于构建语音应用的技术栈。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0030",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "d55f5c115856a2fcb214ff1037f76f6fc144230c5bf9ff1cfc414de1f0245aef",
      "target": "**抖动缓冲区（jitter buffer）。** 网络数据包会乱序或延迟到达。抖动缓冲区对它们重排序并平滑到达节奏；太小 → 可听见的断续，太大 → 延迟。典型值为 60–80 ms。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0032",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Common gotchas"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "cdc300f22a999260ea6f08c5243689e95601324610bfc3ba49f4abc7afcbf55a",
      "target": "### 常见注意事项\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0034",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Common gotchas"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0035",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Common gotchas"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "19d8a33a2c91a666583b140048ba21354d57936ac26eb2536aa903fc4039c653",
      "target": "- **线程争用。** Python 的 GIL（全局解释器锁）加上计算繁重的模型，可能让音频线程得不到运行机会。使用采用 C 回调的音频库（sounddevice、PortAudio），并让 Python 远离关键处理路径。\n- **采样率转换延迟。** 在管线内部重采样会增加 5–20 ms。要么预先重采样，要么使用零延迟重采样器（PolyPhase、`soxr_hq`）。\n- **TTS 预热。** 即使是 Kokoro 这样快速的 TTS，首次请求也有 100–200 ms 的预热时间。缓存模型，并在第一个真实话轮之前通过一次试运行来预热。\n- **回声消除。** 如果没有声学回声消除（AEC），TTS 输出会重新进入麦克风，让 ASR 被机器人的声音触发。WebRTC AEC3 是默认的开源方案。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0036",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Real-Time Audio Processing",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Common gotchas"
      ],
