      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "a02dda764d55e03d92a6a6ea6efac8ba41b6109ed46563d89207a31cf1165b5a",
      "target": "```python\nimport collections\n\nclass RingBuffer:\n    def __init__(self, capacity):\n        self.buf = collections.deque(maxlen=capacity)\n    def write(self, frame):\n        self.buf.extend(frame)\n    def read(self, n):\n        return [self.buf.popleft() for _ in range(min(n, len(self.buf)))]\n    def level(self):\n        return len(self.buf)\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-11:b0044",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
